id: pm-gh1462
title: "GH-1462: Publish host-aligned TOON codecs for extension acceptance tests"
description: "Expose a typed public SDK testing codec over the same pinned TOON implementation used by the host renderer, enabling semantic output assertions without deep imports or duplicated package dependencies."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[6]: "area:extensions","area:sdk",github-intake,output,testing,toon
