author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Public exports decode real host-rendered output semantically; Support encoded and decoded JSON values without quoting assertions; Prove installed/public Node and Bun consumers and TypeScript types; Document the canonical package-author workflow
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Public SDK/testing and aggregate SDK now export host-pinned decodeToon and encodeToon plus native options and JSON value types. Author guidance uses semantic decoded assertions and public imports.
expected_result: Installed Node/Bun and typed package consumers decode actual host TOON without private imports or another dependency pin and preserve native strict codec errors.
actual_result: "Real isolated npm tarball consumers pass on Node26.9 and Bun; strict TypeScript6 public declarations pass with explicit Node ambient types. Actual extension CLI output decodes through public SDK/testing, root/testing function identities match, native options round-trip Unicode/quotes/newline/false/null, malformed row counts reject, and the isolated production dependency audit reports0 vulnerabilities. The generated surface classifies12 additions with no breaking acknowledgement. All10,407 tests pass with3 explicit skips and exact100% lines65062/65062, statements68487/68487, functions14115/14115 and branches52549/52549. The complete local static gate passes, including dependency, docstring, export, ESLint, zero-clone, contract, SDK surface, package-boundary, context, graph, record and bounded mutation gates. All192 broad-regression controls and actual four-way published compatibility rows pass. Failed controls and the earlier two-branch coverage gap are retained; gates and denominators are unchanged."
