  "2026-10-13T21:28:01.116Z","harness:codex","Installed public-tarball acceptance now passes on Node26.9 and Bun, including real inline-placeholder extension dispatch and semantic TOON output through /sdk/testing and /sdk; the strict TypeScript6 consumer succeeds with explicit Node ambient types, and its isolated public-registry production dependency audit reports0 vulnerabilities. The earlier fixture typecheck refusal is preserved. Full repository execution initially exposed4 regressions: root integration-file and compact-document ceilings, the short-only residual-help contract, and an older installed merge fence during the published-artifact compatibility matrix. Corrected by relocating the new integration test, moving detail into focused author contracts, retaining the existing long-only residual guard, and refreshing old fences through the current SDK before current reconciliation. All192 targeted regression cases now pass, including all4 actual published writer/reader combinations with values, hashes, unknown fields, restore, native Git merges and verified history. No threshold, coverage denominator or force override changed. Full source coverage is still running and is not yet certified."
  "2026-10-13T22:02:24.838Z","harness:codex","Real isolated npm tarball consumers pass on Node26.9 and Bun; strict TypeScript6 public declarations pass with explicit Node ambient types. Actual extension CLI output decodes through public SDK/testing, root/testing function identities match, native options round-trip Unicode/quotes/newline/false/null, malformed row counts reject, and the isolated production dependency audit reports0 vulnerabilities. The generated surface classifies12 additions with no breaking acknowledgement. All10,407 tests pass with3 explicit skips and exact100% lines65062/65062, statements68487/68487, functions14115/14115 and branches52549/52549. The complete local static gate passes, including dependency, docstring, export, ESLint, zero-clone, contract, SDK surface, package-boundary, context, graph, record and bounded mutation gates. All192 broad-regression controls and actual four-way published compatibility rows pass. Failed controls and the earlier two-branch coverage gap are retained; gates and denominators are unchanged."
